# C1 implementation report

Only `core/pit_optimizer_v5/memory.py` was edited. `ExperimentRecordV5._validate_post_validation_identity` now requires empty actual changed symbols only for the conjunction of `exact_duplicate` status and parent-equal policy identity. Every other post-validation record retains exact template-symbol equality. Exact identity type, valid policy/validation prerequisites, complete identity validation/derivation and downstream status/evidence checks are unchanged.

